              "content": "{% set n = now() %}\n{% set y = n.year %}\n{% set feb = as_local(as_datetime(y ~ '-02-01')) %}\n{% set aug = as_local(as_datetime(y ~ '-08-01')) %}\n{% if n < feb %}{% set nxt = feb %}{% set prev = as_local(as_datetime((y-1) ~ '-08-01')) %}\n{% elif n < aug %}{% set nxt = aug %}{% set prev = feb %}\n{% else %}{% set nxt = as_local(as_datetime((y+1) ~ '-02-01')) %}{% set prev = aug %}\n{% endif %}\n{% set j = (nxt - n).days %}\n{% set p = states('input_number.prix_du_kwh_alpiq') | float(0) %}\n{% set conso = 19100 %}\n{% if j <= 15 %}🔴 **RÉVISION IMMINENTE**{% elif j <= 45 %}🟠 **RÉVISION PROCHE**{% else %}🟢 **TARIF STABLE**{% endif %} — J-{{ j }}\n\n**Prix kWh** {{ '%.4f'|format(p) | replace('.', ',') }} € · **Abo** 23,76 €/mois\nOffre Alpiq Référence — *indexée sur le TRV*\n\nDernière révision : **{{ prev.strftime('%d/%m/%Y') }}**\nProchaine : **{{ nxt.strftime('%d/%m/%Y') }}**\n\nImpact d'une hausse de 1 % : ~{{ (conso * p * 0.01) | round(0) | int }} €/an"
